Alembic migrations for ap-agent.

The database URL is read from settings in env.py, not from alembic.ini.

  just db-up        start Postgres
  just db-revision "add x"   autogenerate a revision from the models
  just db-migrate   upgrade to head

Two things the autogenerated SQL will not do for you and which the first
migration must add by hand:

  REVOKE UPDATE, DELETE ON audit_events FROM <application_role>;

The audit trail is append-only because the schema says so. An ORM-level
convention is one bug away from being wrong.
